These tests come from musl's libc-test

	https://wiki.musl-libc.org/libc-test.html
	git://nsz.repo.hu:49100/repo/libc-test (mirrored at
	https://repo.or.cz/libc-test.git)

at commit 63e36e934e8f2bedf645303a90b64098e2af6c8f (2026-11-01). They
are covered by the MIT license in COPYRIGHT; AUTHORS lists the
contributors.

Picolibc uses the thread, semaphore and TLS tests from src/functional
and src/regression, along with the parts of src/common they need,
reformatted with picolibc's clang-format configuration but otherwise
unchanged. To update, copy the same files from a newer libc-test, run
clang-format on them and record the new commit here.
